{"seq":1,"slug":"algebraic-types-pattern-matching","title":"代数类型与模式匹配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/type-system/algebraic-types-pattern-matching","wordCount":1678,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"代数类型与模式匹配\">代数类型与模式匹配</h1><p>OCaml 程序员用代数数据类型（ADT）描述数据的形状，用模式匹配解构数据并驱动控制流。这两个机制配合编译器的穷尽性检查，使得「忘记处理某个情况」在编译期就被捕获，而非留到运行时变成 null pointer 或未处理的异常。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>OCaml 的数据建模围绕「代数数据类型」与「模式匹配」这对搭档展开。下面几条命题是本章所有机制的共同基础。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>核心命题</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>直接后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>积类型组合</td>\n<td>元组/记录把多个值打包成一个整体</td>\n<td>字段有名字即自文档化，<code>with</code> 支持函数式更新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>和类型选择</td>\n<td>变体描述「若干形态之一」，构造器可带负载</td>\n<td>编译后仅一个整数 tag，运行时开销极小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模式匹配</td>\n<td>按构造器拆解数据并驱动控制流</td>\n<td>是唯一安全的解构手段，取代运行时类型判断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>穷尽性检查</td>\n<td>编译器验证所有构造器都被处理</td>\n<td>「漏掉一个分支」在编译期即以 Warning 8 报出</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话概括：ADT 负责把数据的形状写进类型，模式匹配负责用完备的分支消费这种形状；两者配合让非法状态在编译期就无法构造。下面几节分别展开积与和的基础、穷尽性检查的实现、多态变体这一开放变体，以及用 ADT 消除非法状态的实战模式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"积类型与记录\">积类型与记录</h2><p>积类型（product type）将多个值打包在一起。OCaml 提供两种积类型：元组和记录。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"type point = { x : float; y : float; z : float }&#10;&#10;type http_response = {&#10;  status : int;&#10;  headers : (string * string) list;&#10;  body : string;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>type point = { x : float; y : float; z : float }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type http_response = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  status : int;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  headers : (string * string) list;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  body : string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>记录与元组的关键区别在于：记录字段有名字，提供自文档化能力；记录支持 mutable 字段实现受控的局部可变性；记录可以使用 <code>with</code> 语法进行函数式更新：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"let move_x delta p = { p with x = p.x +. delta }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>let move_x delta p = { p with x = p.x +. delta }</span></span></code></pre></div><p>OCaml 5.5 还引入了 labeled tuples，为轻量场景提供带名字的元组：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"let result : (x:float * y:float) = (x = 1.0, y = 2.0)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>let result : (x:float * y:float) = (x = 1.0, y = 2.0)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"和类型与变体\">和类型与变体</h2><p>和类型（sum type / variant）描述一个值可能是若干种形态之一。每个构造器可以携带不同类型的负载：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"type json =&#10;  | Null&#10;  | Bool of bool&#10;  | Number of float&#10;  | String of string&#10;  | Array of json list&#10;  | Object of (string * json) list&#10;&#10;type &#39;a result =&#10;  | Ok of &#39;a&#10;  | Error of string\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>type json =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Bool of bool</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Number of float</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | String of string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Array of json list</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Object of (string * json) list</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type 'a result =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Ok of 'a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Error of string</span></span></code></pre></div><p>和类型在编译后被表示为带 tag 的值——不同于 C 的 union，OCaml 的变体是类型安全的，运行时开销仅为一个整数 tag 字段。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>构造器形式</th>\n<th>内存表示</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>无参数（<code>Nil</code>）</td>\n<td>立即值（unboxed integer）</td>\n<td>枚举、标志</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单参数（<code>Some x</code>）</td>\n<td>1-word block + tag</td>\n<td>Option、简单包装</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多参数（<code>Node(l, v, r)</code>）</td>\n<td>n-word block + tag</td>\n<td>树结构、复合数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内联记录（<code>Error {code; msg}</code>）</td>\n<td>与多参数相同但字段有名</td>\n<td>结构化错误信息</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>内联记录（inline record）是 OCaml 4.03 引入的特性，允许在变体构造器中直接定义记录字段：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"type expr =&#10;  | Literal of { value : int }&#10;  | Binary of { op : binop; left : expr; right : expr }&#10;  | Call of { callee : string; args : expr list }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>type expr =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Literal of { value : int }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Binary of { op : binop; left : expr; right : expr }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Call of { callee : string; args : expr list }</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"模式匹配的编译与穷尽性\">模式匹配的编译与穷尽性</h2><p>模式匹配不仅是语法糖——OCaml 编译器将 <code>match</code> 表达式编译为高效的决策树或回溯自动机。穷尽性检查是其核心价值：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"let describe_json = function&#10;  | Null -&gt; &quot;null&quot;&#10;  | Bool b -&gt; Printf.sprintf &quot;bool(%b)&quot; b&#10;  | Number n -&gt; Printf.sprintf &quot;number(%g)&quot; n&#10;  | String s -&gt; Printf.sprintf &quot;string(%S)&quot; s&#10;  | Array _ -&gt; &quot;array&quot;&#10;  (* 编译器警告: this pattern-matching is not exhaustive.&#10;     Here is an example of a case that is not matched: Object _ *)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>let describe_json = function</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Null -> \"null\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Bool b -> Printf.sprintf \"bool(%b)\" b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Number n -> Printf.sprintf \"number(%g)\" n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | String s -> Printf.sprintf \"string(%S)\" s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Array _ -> \"array\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (* 编译器警告: this pattern-matching is not exhaustive.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     Here is an example of a case that is not matched: Object _ *)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>编译器的穷尽性检查算法基于 Maranget 的矩阵分解方法。对于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个模式和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 列的匹配矩阵，算法通过递归分解列来判定是否存在未覆盖的值。时间复杂度在最坏情况下为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n \\cdot m \\cdot 2^m)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，但实际中远优于此。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[match 表达式] --&gt; B{编译器分析}&#10;    B --&gt; C[构建模式矩阵]&#10;    C --&gt; D{穷尽性检查}&#10;    D --&gt;|完备| E[生成决策树]&#10;    D --&gt;|不完备| F[发出 Warning 8]&#10;    E --&gt; G[优化跳转表]&#10;    G --&gt; H[原生机器码]&#10;    F --&gt; I[报告缺失模式示例]\">flowchart TD\n    A[match 表达式] --&gt; B{编译器分析}\n    B --&gt; C[构建模式矩阵]\n    C --&gt; D{穷尽性检查}\n    D --&gt;|完备| E[生成决策树]\n    D --&gt;|不完备| F[发出 Warning 8]\n    E --&gt; G[优化跳转表]\n    G --&gt; H[原生机器码]\n    F --&gt; I[报告缺失模式示例]</pre><h2 id=\"多态变体\">多态变体</h2><p>普通变体要求先声明类型再使用构造器。多态变体（polymorphic variant）允许在无预先声明的情况下使用构造器，类型由使用上下文推断：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"let handle_shape = function&#10;  | `Circle r -&gt; Float.pi *. r *. r&#10;  | `Rect (w, h) -&gt; w *. h&#10;&#10;(* 推断类型: [&lt; `Circle of float | `Rect of float * float ] -&gt; float *)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>let handle_shape = function</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | `Circle r -> Float.pi *. r *. r</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | `Rect (w, h) -> w *. h</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* 推断类型: [&#x3C; `Circle of float | `Rect of float * float ] -> float *)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>多态变体的类型注解使用行类型（row type）系统：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>[&lt; ...]</code> — 封闭上界（至多包含这些构造器）</li>\n<li><code>[&gt; ...]</code> — 开放下界（至少包含这些构造器）</li>\n<li><code>[= ...]</code> — 精确集合</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"type basic_color = [ `Red | `Green | `Blue ]&#10;type extended_color = [ basic_color | `Yellow | `Cyan | `Magenta ]&#10;&#10;let color_to_int : [&lt; extended_color ] -&gt; int = function&#10;  | `Red -&gt; 0xFF0000&#10;  | `Green -&gt; 0x00FF00&#10;  | `Blue -&gt; 0x0000FF&#10;  | `Yellow -&gt; 0xFFFF00&#10;  | `Cyan -&gt; 0x00FFFF&#10;  | `Magenta -&gt; 0xFF00FF\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>type basic_color = [ `Red | `Green | `Blue ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type extended_color = [ basic_color | `Yellow | `Cyan | `Magenta ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let color_to_int : [&#x3C; extended_color ] -> int = function</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | `Red -> 0xFF0000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | `Green -> 0x00FF00</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | `Blue -> 0x0000FF</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | `Yellow -> 0xFFFF00</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | `Cyan -> 0x00FFFF</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | `Magenta -> 0xFF00FF</span></span></code></pre></div><p>多态变体的权衡：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>普通变体</th>\n<th>多态变体</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>声明</td>\n<td>必须预先定义类型</td>\n<td>无需声明，使用即定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>封闭性</td>\n<td>封闭，新增构造器需改源码</td>\n<td>开放，可跨模块自由组合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型推断</td>\n<td>简单直观</td>\n<td>推断类型可能冗长难读</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能</td>\n<td>tag 是编译期常量，O(1) 匹配</td>\n<td>tag 是哈希值，可能需线性搜索</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误信息</td>\n<td>清晰指向类型定义</td>\n<td>可能产生复杂的行类型错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>模块内部数据建模</td>\n<td>可扩展协议、插件系统</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"递归类型与互递归\">递归类型与互递归</h2><p>代数类型天然支持递归定义，这是构建树、链表等递归数据结构的基础：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"type &#39;a binary_tree =&#10;  | Leaf&#10;  | Node of { left : &#39;a binary_tree; value : &#39;a; right : &#39;a binary_tree }&#10;&#10;type expr =&#10;  | Int of int&#10;  | Add of expr * expr&#10;  | Let of { name : string; binding : expr; body : expr }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>type 'a binary_tree =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Leaf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Node of { left : 'a binary_tree; value : 'a; right : 'a binary_tree }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type expr =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Int of int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Add of expr * expr</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Let of { name : string; binding : expr; body : expr }</span></span></code></pre></div><p>互递归类型使用 <code>and</code> 关键字连接：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"type statement =&#10;  | Expr of expression&#10;  | If of { cond : expression; then_ : statement list; else_ : statement list }&#10;  | While of { cond : expression; body : statement list }&#10;&#10;and expression =&#10;  | Literal of int&#10;  | Var of string&#10;  | FunCall of { name : string; args : expression list }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>type statement =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Expr of expression</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | If of { cond : expression; then_ : statement list; else_ : statement list }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | While of { cond : expression; body : statement list }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>and expression =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Literal of int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Var of string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | FunCall of { name : string; args : expression list }</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"实战模式-用-adt-消除非法状态\">实战模式：用 ADT 消除非法状态</h2><p>代数数据类型最深刻的工程价值在于「make illegal states unrepresentable」——通过类型设计使非法状态在编译期就无法构造：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"(* 错误设计：任何字段组合都合法，需运行时校验 *)&#10;type connection_bad = {&#10;  state : string;  (* &quot;connecting&quot; | &quot;connected&quot; | &quot;closed&quot; *)&#10;  socket : Unix.file_descr option;&#10;  error : string option;&#10;}&#10;&#10;(* 正确设计：每个状态精确描述其携带的数据 *)&#10;type connection =&#10;  | Connecting of { addr : Unix.sockaddr; timeout : float }&#10;  | Connected of { socket : Unix.file_descr; since : float }&#10;  | Closed of { reason : close_reason }&#10;&#10;and close_reason =&#10;  | Normal&#10;  | Error of { code : int; message : string }&#10;  | Timeout\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(* 错误设计：任何字段组合都合法，需运行时校验 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type connection_bad = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  state : string;  (* \"connecting\" | \"connected\" | \"closed\" *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  socket : Unix.file_descr option;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  error : string option;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* 正确设计：每个状态精确描述其携带的数据 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type connection =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Connecting of { addr : Unix.sockaddr; timeout : float }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Connected of { socket : Unix.file_descr; since : float }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Closed of { reason : close_reason }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>and close_reason =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Normal</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Error of { code : int; message : string }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Timeout</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在第二种设计中：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>Connected</code> 状态必然有 socket——不可能出现「状态是 connected 但 socket 为 None」</li>\n<li><code>Closed</code> 状态精确记录关闭原因——不可能出现「关闭了但 error 字段为空」</li>\n<li>模式匹配强制调用者处理每种状态——不可能忘记某个分支</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这种「类型即契约」的思维贯穿 OCaml 系统编程的方方面面。在 <a href=\"polymorphism-type-inference\">多态与类型推断</a> 中将看到如何用参数多态让这些类型定义更加泛化，在 <a href=\"gadt-phantom-types\">GADT 与幻影类型</a> 中则会看到如何编码更精细的类型级不变量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"模式匹配的高级语法\">模式匹配的高级语法</h2><p>OCaml 的模式匹配支持多种组合器，使复杂匹配逻辑保持可读性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"(* or-pattern：多个模式共享同一分支 *)&#10;let is_whitespace = function&#10;  | &#39; &#39; | &#39;\\t&#39; | &#39;\\n&#39; | &#39;\\r&#39; -&gt; true&#10;  | _ -&gt; false&#10;&#10;(* as-pattern：绑定整体的同时解构内部 *)&#10;let rec find_min = function&#10;  | Node { left = Leaf; value; _ } -&gt; value&#10;  | Node { left = (Node _ as subtree); _ } -&gt; find_min subtree&#10;  | Leaf -&gt; failwith &quot;empty tree&quot;&#10;&#10;(* when-guard：添加运行时条件 *)&#10;let classify_response = function&#10;  | { status; _ } when status &gt;= 200 &amp;&amp; status &lt; 300 -&gt; `Success&#10;  | { status; _ } when status &gt;= 400 &amp;&amp; status &lt; 500 -&gt; `ClientError&#10;  | { status; _ } when status &gt;= 500 -&gt; `ServerError&#10;  | _ -&gt; `Other&#10;&#10;(* 嵌套模式解构 *)&#10;let rec eval env = function&#10;  | Int n -&gt; n&#10;  | Add (e1, e2) -&gt; eval env e1 + eval env e2&#10;  | Let { name; binding; body } -&gt;&#10;    let v = eval env binding in&#10;    eval ((name, v) :: env) body\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(* or-pattern：多个模式共享同一分支 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let is_whitespace = function</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | ' ' | '\\t' | '\\n' | '\\r' -> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | _ -> false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* as-pattern：绑定整体的同时解构内部 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let rec find_min = function</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Node { left = Leaf; value; _ } -> value</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Node { left = (Node _ as subtree); _ } -> find_min subtree</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Leaf -> failwith \"empty tree\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* when-guard：添加运行时条件 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let classify_response = function</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | { status; _ } when status >= 200 &#x26;&#x26; status &#x3C; 300 -> `Success</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | { status; _ } when status >= 400 &#x26;&#x26; status &#x3C; 500 -> `ClientError</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | { status; _ } when status >= 500 -> `ServerError</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | _ -> `Other</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* 嵌套模式解构 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let rec eval env = function</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Int n -> n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Add (e1, e2) -> eval env e1 + eval env e2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Let { name; binding; body } -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let v = eval env binding in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    eval ((name, v) :: env) body</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>exception</code> 模式（OCaml 4.02+）允许在 <code>match</code> 中同时处理正常返回和异常：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"let safe_divide x y =&#10;  match x / y with&#10;  | result -&gt; Some result&#10;  | exception Division_by_zero -&gt; None\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>let safe_divide x y =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  match x / y with</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | result -> Some result</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | exception Division_by_zero -> None</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>积与和组合出数据的形状</strong>：元组/记录表达「同时具有」，变体表达「其中之一」，两者叠加足以描述绝大多数据结构。</li>\n<li><strong>模式匹配是唯一安全的解构手段</strong>：它取代运行时的类型判断，配合穷尽性检查把「忘记处理某个情况」提前到编译期。</li>\n<li><strong>编译器把匹配编译为决策树/回溯自动机</strong>，穷尽性判定基于 Maranget 的矩阵分解方法——这是「高级语法仍保持高效」的原因。</li>\n<li><strong>多态变体提供开放的变体</strong>：无需预先声明、可跨模块组合，代价是 tag 为哈希值、类型错误信息更冗长。</li>\n<li><strong>最大的工程价值是消除非法状态</strong>：把状态机的每个状态写成一个构造器、只在该状态携带其应有的数据，可以让「connected 却没有 socket」这类错误根本无法表达。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>代数类型与模式匹配共同构成 OCaml 编程的核心范式——几乎所有 OCaml 代码都建立在对数据的精确建模与对分支的完备处理之上。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"代数类型与模式匹配","id":"代数类型与模式匹配"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"积类型与记录","id":"积类型与记录"},{"level":2,"text":"和类型与变体","id":"和类型与变体"},{"level":2,"text":"模式匹配的编译与穷尽性","id":"模式匹配的编译与穷尽性"},{"level":2,"text":"多态变体","id":"多态变体"},{"level":2,"text":"递归类型与互递归","id":"递归类型与互递归"},{"level":2,"text":"实战模式：用 ADT 消除非法状态","id":"实战模式-用-adt-消除非法状态"},{"level":2,"text":"模式匹配的高级语法","id":"模式匹配的高级语法"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"多态与类型推断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/type-system/polymorphism-type-inference"}}